High level python web framework
Designed for fast, secure and scaleable development
Follows MVT (model view template)

Key features:
batteries included: built in tools for authentication, ORM and admin panel
scalable: from small apps to large
secure: provides protection against SQL injection, CSRF
cross platfoam: work on windows, linux, mac

eg: instagram, pinterest are made using django

